creation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/presque-isle-state-park/hiking","source_title":"Hiking at Presque Isle State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"No park entrance or day-use fee applies. Stay on the official trail and check current park conditions before departing.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"north-pier-light-walk","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"North Pier Light","title":"Walk Out to North Pier Light","subtitle":"A free harbor-channel sightseeing walk","notes":"Follow the public route toward the light, watch boats move through the harbor channel, and turn back if waves reach the walkway.","short_summary":"Watch Erie’s working harbor from a historic pier light.","evidence_claim":"Pennsylvania DCNR states that visitors can walk to North Pier Light and watch harbor-channel boat traffic; state parks charge no entrance fee.","source_url":"https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/recreation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/presque-isle-state-park/history","source_title":"History of Presque Isle State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=North%20Pier%20Light%20Presque%20Isle%20Erie%20PA","access_notes":"Presque Isle has no entrance or day-use fee. Use the public walkway only and avoid the pier during rough water or hazardous weather.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"beach-11-kohler-swim","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Beach 11 (Kohler Beach)","title":"Swim at Kohler Beach","subtitle":"A guarded-season beach hang at Presque Isle","notes":"Check the guarded-zone status, meet near the beach house, and keep the group inside the marked swimming area while lifeguards are present.","short_summary":"Cool off together at a sheltered Lake Erie beach.","evidence_claim":"Pennsylvania DCNR identifies Beach 11 as a sheltered designated beach and permits swimming only in open guarded zones; state parks have no day-use fee.","source_url":"https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/recreation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/presque-isle-state-park/swimming","source_title":"Swimming at Presque Isle State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Beach%2011%20Kohler%20Beach%20Presque%20Isle%20PA","access_notes":"No entrance or day-use fee applies. Swim only when the beach is open, lifeguards are present, and the guarded zone is designated.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gull-point-trail-nature-walk","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Gull Point Trail","title":"Take a Gull Point Nature Walk","subtitle":"A 1.5-mile route through a protected natural area","notes":"Check trail conditions at TREC, pack water, and remain on the marked surface to protect nesting birds and wet habitats.","short_summary":"See shifting dunes and habitat succession on a careful group hike.","evidence_claim":"Pennsylvania DCNR documents Gull Point Trail as a 1.5-mile hiking route through the natural area; Pennsylvania state parks have no entrance fee.","source_url":"https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/recreation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/presque-isle-state-park/hiking","source_title":"Hiking at Presque Isle State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gull%20Point%20Trail%20Presque%20Isle%20PA","access_notes":"No park entrance or day-use fee applies. From April 1 through October 31, remain on the trail surface because of nesting birds.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
